# The empty list offers Add; typed tasks land on the list one after another
# without the keyboard going away between them.
wait-for Nothing to do
expect Write down the first thing to do.
clean
shot todo-empty
tap Add a task
wait-for New item
type water the fern
expect water the fern
clean
shot todo-new
tap Add
wait-for Added
expect New item
type buy milk
tap Add
expect Todo: 2 left
tap Done
wait-for water the fern
expect buy milk
expect-missing Nothing to do
clean
shot todo-list
